l_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L22, L51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_cs_portal_sharing_workflow", "label": "CS Team Portal Borrowing, OTP & Integration Workflow", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Coordinates turn-taking, OTP code issuance (Rachel Ly and Kath Vo), HealthSherpa integration, and explicit logout handoffs across shared NPN portals (PT, AQP/AQ, ALP, MN, LN).", "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L56-L136", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_nhi_tran_aut_screen_issue", "label": "HealthSherpa Client Authorization Screen Sync Issue (Nhi Tran)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Client side displays an authorization completion screen while Nhi Tran's HealthSherpa check still shows Unauthorized; Wendy Vo escalated to the CS team for troubleshooting solutions.", "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L121-L122", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_payment_bill_check_case", "label": "Billing & Payment Case Check (Quyen Le / Sean Ngo)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L29, L145-L147", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_presidio_2027_preventative_rule", "label": "Presidio 2026 Wellness vs 2027 With Preventative Plan Rule & Portal Bug", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Presidio renamed 2026 'Wellness' to 'with Preventative' for 2027 products; Khanh Nguyen observed $2,500 MOOP + Preventative appearing for 1- and 3-person households but missing for 2