ng Oscar OB 11/2026 Deal (Tri Chau)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L33, L211", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_uhc_tx_npn_switch_aqp_to_alp", "label": "UHC Texas NPN Switch: AQP to ALP (Contract Effective December)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "NPN AQP currently lacks a carrier contract with UHC, so Tiger Truong switches Quyen Nguyen's TX deal from AQP to NPN ALP, with contract counted in December.", "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L35, L220", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_kaiser_truecare_doctor_rule", "label": "Kaiser GA: Doctor True Care Accepting New Clients", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Confirmed via direct phone call to Doctor True Care (Dr. Ngoc Phan Do) that they still accept new Kaiser clients, enabling Tiger Truong to apply the PCP for Lan Nguyen's client.", "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L16, L233", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_ga_household_peachcare_split", "label": "Georgia Household Split: 21yo Full-Time Worker Separate ACA vs PeachCare", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "A 21-year-old working full-time (~$22k income) and not attending school is separated onto their own ACA plan rather than remaining on the mother's policy, while the mother + 18yo apply for ACA ($22k income) and the 12yo is routed to PeachCare.", "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L37, L234", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_ar_2026_carrier_contract_rule", "label": "Arkansas (AR) 2026 Carrier Rule: Ambetter Contracted vs BCBS $0 Commission", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "TBR has no carrier contract with BCBS in Arkansas for 2026 (only Ambetter is contracted); Agents are advised to re-quote December clients with Ambetter because keeping BCBS yields $0 commission.", "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L40, L242-L243", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_doc", "target": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_hsp_crm_aut_migration", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L20-L21, L49-L51", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_doc", "target": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_missing_aut_audit_directive", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L22, L51", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_doc", "target": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_cs_portal_sharing_workflow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L56-L136", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_doc", "target": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_08_nhi_tran_aut_screen_issue", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "RingCentral_Summaries/Daily_Summary_2026-11-08.md", "source_location": "L121-L122", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ringcentral_summaries_daily_summary_2026_11_